"paragraph","text":"でもその分、その一回一回に全力で取り組めます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからいまは、自分にできることはなにか考えて、それを精一杯取り組んでいきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーメンバーとしてずっとやってきて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ目立つ存在ではないのがわかっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それなのに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログや握手会で応援してるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ってね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくださったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブを見て、レッスン頑張ってるんだね、これからも頑張れ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくださってるのが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しくて、いまのわたしを支えています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その一言で、今日も、明日もこれからもずっと頑張っていこうと思えます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから、少しずつでもみなさんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という人を知ってもらいたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんの期待に応えられるように、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも引き続き頑張っていきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてアンダーからやっと選抜に入った、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃん、せいたん、ゆみ姉..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に本当におめでとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３人の頑張りをアンダー含め、乃木坂みんな知ってるからこそ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しくて涙が出てきた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーの分も頑張ってください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるも頑張るからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/6198885/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宜しくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/19/6198885/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもいつもわたしを支えてくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるん"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-15372":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"MUSIC FAIR\nミュージックドラゴン\nチェックありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/11/25/8106853/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒いふぁさふぁさした帽子\n帽子だいすき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また髪がだいぶ伸びたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイロンのせいか\n毛先がどんどん茶色になってきてる。\n染めてる？ってよく聞かれるけど\n染めてないんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"染めてみたい気持ちはあるけど、\n染めたら元の色には戻れないって\n聞くので染める勇気がない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グリーンアッシュが入った\n髪色にしてる人すきなんだよなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はふわふわした\nウェーブ巻きがすきです。\n夜寝る前に三つ編みして\n貧乏パーマするのもはまってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/11/25/8106853/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達とランチしました。\n眼鏡だし\nシャツにニット\nシャツにベストで\n2人ともきっちり感があった笑\n落ち着くぜー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日一日興奮が収まらない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お腹がうずうずしてます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしましょう..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーーーーしあ わ   せ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/11/25/8106853/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せの舞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-14565":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪を15cm程切りました。\n結構切ったんだけど\n変化に気付いてもらえますか？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超ロングからロングにしても\n気付いてもらえない悲しさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに1番仲のいい友達は\n気付いてくれませんでした(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ（＾ω＾）\nアメブロもよかったら\n見てくださいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://s.ameblo.jp/nogizakablog/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10.6\n乃木坂46真夏の全国ツアーFINAL\nにお越し下さった皆様。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"安定の純奈たん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達二期生はステージに立つのは\nまだ三度目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのステージが代々木第一体育館。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて恵まれた環境にいるんだろうと\n感じております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"常にその事に感謝をしながら\n精一杯自分を甘やかす事なく\n頑張りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"涙ころ衣装"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと着たかった\n大好きな衣装です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに「私服で着てそう！」\nと言われました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この衣装は二期生で1番\n似合う自信がある。ドヤァァ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会いたかったかもしれない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のマネキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプーの時、\n私を先頭にステージを移動したので\n後ろが詰まらないよう\n全力疾走してました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど私は足が遅......おっと\nこれは運動会のところで。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水玉模様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演出が凝っていたので\nみんなで何回も練習しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんのセリフの部分\nだいすきです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロマンティックいか焼き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウス！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指望遠鏡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盛り上がる曲ゾーン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！\n母と姉が来ていたんですが\nハウスの踊る位置が\n2人の本当にど目の前で\n恥ずかしかったです(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜ母と姉に\n「好き好き」言わなきゃ\nいけないのか...(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハウスのそのあとの位置が\nまあやさんと隣で\n楽しかったなあ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやさんらぶ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大運動会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つ、ついにバレタ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の運動神経の悪さ＿|￣|○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"活発な性格から\n運動神経良く見られるんですが\n誰よりも悪いんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん...？誰よりも...？\nあ、私より遅い方が\n同じチームにいらっしゃいましたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで私と真夏さんのせいで\n昼夜ともに赤組負けてしまい\n非常に申し訳なかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生徒会長20才コンビを\nお許しください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズム"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君の名は希望"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サインボールを投げたんですが\n変な投げ方をしてしまって\n昼公演でぶつかりそうに\nなってた方すみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"getした方、私のでごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"捨てないでくださいね（；＿；）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ!bicycle"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐるぐるカーテンの時\nずっと応援してきたグループの\n大切なこの曲を\nずっとなりたかったアイドルとして\n代々木第一体育館で\n歌ってると考えたら\n涙が止まらなくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人間という楽器(昼)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガールズルール(夜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に目一杯会場を回って\n改めてこの会場でのライブに\n出演させていただく有難さを\n噛み締めながら歌ってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん～～↑！とか\nかりん↑ちゃ～～ん！とか\n沢山聞こえたし\nうちわやボードも見えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブが全部終わったあと\n若月さんが素敵な言葉を\nかけてくださって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで抱え込んでたものが\n解放されて\n涙が止まらなくなってしまって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな顔になってました(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月さんが若様って呼ばれる意味を\n身を持って感じました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今だけ呼ばせてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若様、だいすきです。///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外にこんなのぼりが出てました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん党のみんなはもちろん\nこののぼりの前で\n記念撮影したよね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉さんが撮って来てくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉さん～、指写ってる(￣▽￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな方がブログに\n書いていますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のライブを通して\n一期生二期生の距離が\n少し縮まった気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未熟な私たち二期生に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指導してくださる\n一期生の方もいらっしゃいますし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しく話しかけてくださる\n一期生の方もいらっしゃいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもたくさん迷惑を\n掛けてしまいますが、\nよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"武道館に向けて\nまた新たに頑張りますので\nファンの皆様、\n今後も応援よろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7枚目シングルの\n選抜がついに発表されました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりずっと乃木坂46を\n応援していると\n初選抜の方がいらっしゃるのが\n嬉しくて嬉しくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後さん衛藤さん中元さん\n本当におめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその一方で選抜落ちされる方が\nいらっしゃるのが\n悔しくて悔しくて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうにか一期生全員選抜に\nなれないのかなあ...と\nどうしても思ってしまいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表を今まで涙無しに\n見れた事のない私は\n今回初めて間近で見学させて頂き\n号泣してしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この選抜制度が本当に大変で\n過酷なものだと\nひしひしと感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、センターに選ばれた\n堀未央奈。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、何かある気はしていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそれが二期生から\n単独の選抜入りで\nそしてセンターとは\nさすがに驚きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一期生の方々、二期生のみんな\nそして未央奈。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれがいろんな感情で\n涙を流してました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんで？って思われる方も\nいらっしゃると思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"簡単には受け入れられない\nものだと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、乃木坂を潰したくて\nこういう結果にしたスタッフさんは\n絶対いないと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂を良くするために\n考えぬいてこういう結果に\nなったんだと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったら、新しい風の吹く\n乃木坂46を受け入れなきゃなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も乃木坂33人(34人)\nと言っている時代が大好きなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ヲタクとして\n正直、\nかなり違和感は感じます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも私は乃木坂46二期生です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生として、\n二期生の先陣を切ってくれた未央奈\n乃木坂の顔として\n頑張ってくれる未央奈を\n全力でサポートします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0018.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"都会に出てきたばかりの\n右も左も分からない\n16歳の少女を叱咤激励し\nみんなで支えていきましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈本当におめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は6thシングル最後の個握！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日が終わると当分握手会なくて\nさみし過ぎてどうしよう( p′︵‵。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず明日の個握を\n全力で楽しみましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/40006/img/files/46/_pre/blog/kenkyusei/img/2013/10/12/8067879/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のレーンは～？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部 山﨑怜奈"},{"type":"image","src":"h